│ ─ plans ── <age>
│   Back off in the sync worker
│
│   The worker retries a 429 at once, three
│   times, and the API locks the key for a
│   minute.
│
│   Steps
│
│   1. Read Retry-After from the response,
│      seconds or a date.
│   2. Sleep that long before the next
│      attempt, capped at five minutes.
